1
00:00:03,670 --> 00:00:06,570
(Leonard:)I know you guys don't want to do this,
but we have no choice.

2
00:00:06,773 --> 00:00:09,473
(Leonard:)You can either bitch and whine
or we can get it over with.

3
00:00:09,642 --> 00:00:11,972
- I got whine.
- I got the B-word.

4
00:00:12,846 --> 00:00:16,146
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, it's in our contract
to serve on a university committee.

5
00:00:16,316 --> 00:00:18,716
(Leonard:)And frankly,
this is one I believe in, okay? Here:

6
00:00:18,885 --> 00:00:21,685
(Leonard:)Encouraging more women
to pursue a career in the sciences.

7
00:00:21,855 --> 00:00:24,555
Come on, if I was good
at convincing women to do stuff...

8
00:00:24,724 --> 00:00:27,784
(Howard:)...I wouldn't have spent
so much of my 20's in the shower. Heh.

9
00:00:29,729 --> 00:00:32,389
(Sheldon:)If you ask me,
this whole thing is a waste of our time.

10
00:00:32,565 --> 00:00:35,505
- Helping women?
- Yeah, helping anyone.

11
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,736
(Sheldon:)People should take care of themselves.

12
00:00:38,905 --> 00:00:42,395
(Leonard:)Oh, like yesterday when you
made me drive you to the dry cleaners...

13
00:00:42,575 --> 00:00:44,335
(Leonard:)...the pharmacy and the post office?

14
00:00:44,511 --> 00:00:46,941
(Sheldon:)I'm not saying people can't use tools.

15
00:00:48,948 --> 00:00:51,608
(Sheldon:)Even an otter picks up a rock
when he wants a clam.

16
00:00:53,319 --> 00:00:56,379
You don't think it's worthwhile to get
more women in science?

17
00:00:56,556 --> 00:00:58,686
(Sheldon:)I think that's incredibly sexist of you.

18
00:00:59,059 --> 00:01:02,519
(Sheldon:)I believe in a gender-blind society
like in Star Trek...

